 "kind": "answer",
 "message": "I checked the remote work and expenses policies, and neither mentions a home office stipend or any allowance for setting up a home office. So I can't confirm that one exists.\n\nWhat the policies do cover:\n- POL-REM-01: Office-based employees may work remotely up to 2 days a week, agreed with their manager. Fully remote arrangements need VP approval. Working from another country is allowed for up to 20 working days per calendar year, with HR approval at least 2 weeks in advance.\n- POL-EXP-01: Expenses are submitted in the HR portal within 30 days, with a receipt for anything over $25. Your manager approves them.\n\nIf you want to know whether a home office stipend exists, HR is the team to ask. I can escalate the question to them if you'd like.",
 "cited_policy_ids": [
  "POL-REM-01",
  "POL-EXP-01"
 ]
}
